          "reason": "Initialize five keyboard loop guards before testing them. Bound difficulty filename construction and load only complete in-range Sudoku records. Decode complete signed9bit mouse deltas with header sign bits. Clock/timer repaints draw the cursor without applying a partially received mouse packet. Timer-only repaints also skip cell/Back click processing, because no new mouse input arrived. Read at most three high scores and require successful scans, preventing writes past a[3].",
          "verification": "Original optimized actual WASM unreachable→corrected real menu after guard initialization; owning compiled menu fixture checks timer then actual Escape. Original difficulty path stack overflow RED SIGTRAP→GREEN allthree difficulties and malformed/out-of-range input rejection. Original full signed9bit delta fixture RED→GREEN121pairs preserving originalgain2 and64x51glyph clamps. Actual menu partialheader+x→RTC→Escape interleaving RED unintended cursor motion→GREEN unchanged cursor until a full packet. Additional owning clock redraw fixture RED requests keyboard input from a held cell without any new mouse packet; GREEN repaints without opening an editor."
        },
        {
          "file": "proj/code/mouse.c",
          "originalSha256": "2d5ef265052ab57b254d196fff4383eea547ca04bcc48303312af62b7f52690c",
          "patchedSha256": "6d35e4186026d8695fdce13401702de72bb278c790f0c2cff0d8db4b80830ae7",
          "reason": "Consume and validate each original F4/F5 command response through existing get_packets before entering game packet processing, so ACK cannot be mistaken for motion.",
          "verification": "Owning original command fixture RED leaves pending ACK; GREEN enable/disable each consume one ACK and reject RESEND cleanly. Actual ordinary touch now enters Play/Easy and selects/edits a board cell."
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
